[{"client_msg_id":"5aeabc5b-366a-44fb-a603-57bcb2f97bce","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まぁコード（POC）で語ったほうが齟齬が少なそう","ts":"1629871022.106200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GKXAF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75a63117-19ba-4805-8196-a27c04f69293","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"IO がボトルネックなので CPU バウンドなフィルタ処理を並列化しても旨味はない...","ts":"1629870979.105600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2oY5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c046deff-99b5-4b16-87b7-57293f6695a6","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"フィルタ部分の並列化は出来ると思いますが、それはあまり意味がないかと","ts":"1629870963.105300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fte"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02014cb6-f9b3-4d40-a805-2160c6086b3d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"部分的なソートを掛け続けるしか無い気がします...","ts":"1629870916.104800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F/U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0968d6c-bcc1-46ac-8bbd-07b7c8089922","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"完全なソートは全候補が揃うまで無理ですね。全候補が揃うのを待つかどうかは仕様次第では？","ts":"1629870888.104400","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1629870898.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sx="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ada846f-49e8-4bee-96be-276158efc1d7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"フィルタなどを並列にすることを考えるとだいぶややこしそうですね。","ts":"1629870477.103000","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1629870487.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yO4k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a68a02b-f353-43d1-a087-d502869a5581","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"実装は美しくなくなる","ts":"1629870384.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q0aZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8c35af8-94e5-4840-8c1e-7af23022aae4","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"考えたのだけれど、全候補をsource毎に分割してソートすれば対応可能ではある","ts":"1629870370.101500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EAY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abac8a59-a743-4885-ae8a-d08b05a73b17","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"フィルタ部分の並列化ができないですよね","ts":"1629870327.100100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XKU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78959348-be25-4c60-a546-67b2f68aa807","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"「進捗ダメです」","ts":"1629869987.098900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nXO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e305b556-2359-4e8c-8a28-656d7052a0c2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"補完と違って進捗管理がいりそうなので、この方式だと別途 EventDispatcher 的な機構が必要になってあまり美しくないかもしれないですね。。。","ts":"1629869941.098700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XSoF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ec74400-c108-43d5-8a8b-9c19ce8479e7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"上記は擬似コードです。","ts":"1629869748.097500","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1629869825.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OgP8g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89dbb853-0737-4741-bf67-b51d404842d9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これのメリットはこんな感じの処理にできるところですね。\n```const allItems = [];\nfor (const source of sources) {\n  allItems.merge(source.items); // ここでソース毎の足切りやフィルタ、なんならソートをできる\n}\nallItems // ここで全体合わせたソートや足切りができる```","ts":"1629869736.097200","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1629869788.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gXF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ad5c479-3077-4fad-bf6c-52e941a0a904","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"補完とは許容できる幅が全然違いそう","ts":"1629869690.096200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8I2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f83a23d-889a-49b9-a685-4a4c13c2c9c2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"sourceA.items\nsourceB.items\nsourceC.items\n\n各ソースの `.items` が非同期的に更新され続けている。という状態を自分は割とイメージしています。（compe とか cmp もそういう設計です。）","ts":"1629869651.095200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7FOxV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20c9979d-1c3e-428c-97df-26402217c95c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"candidates切り捨ては最悪仕様と言い張ることはできるけどソートについてはどうだろうか","ts":"1629869374.094400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sY9T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54508f32-4e0f-4292-995c-73a0301f8cf3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ソートの問題とsource毎のcandidates切り捨てはできない（全体の切り捨てはできる）","ts":"1629869315.093600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"15Xd7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7244acd6-97a4-4c08-a8e5-04464e1bf85b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vimとは異なりsourceの位置を補正する必要はないけれど","ts":"1629869283.092700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E=Ef0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46252c41-7660-4d4e-b79f-91b8d2249fab","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"その手法だと正しいソートができないんですよね","ts":"1629869246.091900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6DQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f96da8bb-3f1c-448c-b3b5-4af346f427bf","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"前のメモを見返したんですけど","ts":"1629869228.091400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ytg"}]},{"clie